# HOW TO MAKE THE COMPLETE GUIDES

Do a pull of tbrunp, look at the /docsHelp folder and all the help files in there, and
write the three complete reference guides below from the content listed for each.

This file is the table of contents, categorised by how the help files are structured:
Product Help Files are unique to one product; Common Help Files apply across all three.

Work one guide at a time so each can be approved before the next is started. Start with
Agilebars.

NOT compiled into the complete guides (deployment and sales material, not product help):
Customer Ownership Installation Options, Getting Started.

ALSO NOT compiled: the User Interface Guide's opening chapter, "Why These Products Work
the Way They Do". The rest of that guide IS compiled. The chapter is positioning and
sales material and sits under a single `##` heading, so it lifts out cleanly.

